{"id":"647933","name":"牛肉汤粉","author":"小洞天","authorId":"126119","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/647933/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米粉","amount":"300g（两碗）"},{"name":"红烧牛肉","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄豆芽","amount":"50g"},{"name":"豆腐皮","amount":"30g"},{"name":"火锅底料","amount":"少许"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香葱洗净切碎。","img":"images/647933/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"烧好的牛肉丁。","img":"images/647933/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"米粉用清水浸泡4小时左右。","img":"images/647933/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再煮2分钟左右。","img":"images/647933/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用清水冲洗两遍。","img":"images/647933/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒锅放少许油，放适量火锅底料。","img":"images/647933/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入两碗开水。","img":"images/647933/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入烧好的牛肉丁。","img":"images/647933/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入黄豆芽和豆腐皮，少许生抽。","img":"images/647933/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入米粉、盐和鸡精。","img":"images/647933/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"开锅煮片刻，放入生菜，煮至断生。","img":"images/647933/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/647933/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"浸泡过的米粉稍煮片刻即可，口感更加筋道顺滑。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}